  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250503DF684C0}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Situation"
   m_sTextData "MEC forces have been stationed at the Western dam defending it from an onslaught of Russian forces whom have been tasked to level the dam itself. While the MEC are weary and running out of supplies, the opposing side is said to be amassing the last of their forces in the region. Intel suggests that the Russian forces are unable to communicate over long ranges with the artillery support necessary to cause the breach, thus, MEC forces are to defend the surrounding territory and restrict access to the MCOM radios, otherwise the local ecosystems will collapse.  "\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR Composition: MEC Infantry"\
   "BLUFOR Assets: M. MMG, M. MAT"\
   ""\
   "OPFOR Composition: USSR 2000s Mech. Infantry"\
   "OPFOR Assets: MMG, Gun Trucks"\
   ""\
   "Time: Afternoon"\
   ""\
   "Weather: Overcast"\
   ""
   m_aFactionKeys {
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051F2E00216}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Defend the MCOM Radios from OPFOR."\
   ""\
   "This terrain is open and hilly. Due to low supply, you do not have access to entrenching tools, utilize the terrain to your advantage to stunt OPFOR's attack."
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{64425051B9B5AF67}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Your mission is simple. Gain access to the MCOM radios and call for fire support on the dam. "\
   ""\
   "This terrain is open and hilly. Chances are that contact will be heavy once met. Plan accordingly. "
   m_aFactionKeys +{
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{644250519BE30999}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData "MCOMA & MCOMB: Deliver HE Arty strikes to the East/West sides, respectively, of the dam."\
   ""\
   "MCOMC: Delivers Smoke Arty strikes to the East side of the dam."
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "BLUFOR"
    ""
    ""
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  CRF_MissionDescriptor "{6442505149CF6C93}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData "(Note: Destroying each MCOM will call in an artillery barrage on the dam"\
   "MCOMA & MCOMB: Deliver HE Arty strikes to the East/West sides, respectively, of the dam."\
   ""\
   "MCOMC: Delivers Smoke Arty strikes to the East side of the dam.)"\
   ""\
   "MCOMD: You win! Good luck."\
   ""
